{"id":"explosio_n","lemma":"explosión","pos":"noun","rank":1527,"glosses":["explosion, blast, bang, burst, boom","bang, boom"],"ipa":"/eɡsploˈsjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"explosiones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-explosi%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Cuál fue la causa de la explosión?","en":"What was the cause of the explosion?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/610927","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"cause"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"of the"]]},{"text":"Oí tres explosiones.","en":"I heard three explosions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/506276","words":[{"g":"to hear","l":"oír"},{"g":"three"},null]},{"text":"Hubo una explosión.","en":"There was an explosion.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460898","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"La gran explosión mató a seis personas.","en":"The huge explosion killed six people.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692984","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,null,{"g":"to kill, slay","l":"matar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"six"},{"g":"person (an individual","l":"persona"}]},{"text":"¿Dónde estabas cuando ocurrió la explosión?","en":"Where were you when the explosion occurred?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"when"},{"g":"to happen, to occur","l":"ocurrir"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}